# BoardSim backend — this directory is outside the DocumentRoot.
#
# It is deployed as a sibling of public_html (e.g. /home/USER/boardsim-app) and
# Apache therefore never reads this file. It exists for one reason: if a document
# root is ever pointed here by mistake, deny everything rather than serve src/,
# config.local.php, scenarios/ and the regulatory register as static files.
#
# If you can read this in a browser, your DocumentRoot is wrong and you are
# exposing the application's source and its configuration pointer.

Require all denied
